# --- Network Download Path (hash_mismatch) ---
# Entered when the disk binary's hash does not match the expected hash.
# Allocates a bitmap on the stack to track which chunks have been received,
# zeros it, loads the seed list, and begins the network download process
# by falling through to setup_net.

# ── hash_mismatch: ──
