# --- RSP_CHUNK Handler (not_arp through chunk copy) ---
# Validates incoming FAMC RSP_CHUNK packets: checks minimum length (574),
# verifies EtherType=IPv4, protocol=UDP, and the 4-byte "FAMC" magic at
# the expected offset. Confirms type byte is 0x82 (RSP_CHUNK). Extracts
# the 16-bit chunk sequence number, bounds-checks it, checks the bitmap
# to skip duplicates, computes the destination offset (seq * CHUNK_SIZE),
# copies the chunk data into LOAD_LOC + offset, marks the bitmap bit,
# refreshes the timeout, and increments the received count. When all
# chunks are received (count == 1), hashes and verifies the download,
# then jumps to the loaded program on success.

